    "ToolOption": {
      "description": "Tool option (multiple alternatives per tool slot).\n\nCDDA accepts these JSON shapes: - A plain string: `\"hammer\"` (count=1, no charges) - A 2-element array: `[\"hammer\", 2]` (item ID + count; count may be -1) - A 3-element array: `[\"soldering_iron\", 1, 100]` (item ID + count + charges) - A 3-element array with string flag: `[\"metalworking_tongs_any\", 1, \"LIST\"]` - An object: `{\"item\": \"soldering_iron\", \"count\": 1, \"charges\": 100}`",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "description": "Plain string ID: `\"hammer\"` (implies count=1, no charges).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "description": "Simple pair: `[\"item_id\", required_count]` (count may be -1).",
          "type": "array",
          "items": [
